    "title": "多: Use number+classifier+多 for a little beyond a quantity",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk2-quantities-p06-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "多: Use number+classifier+多 for a little beyond a quantity",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "With a small measured excess, 多 can follow the unit: one unit and a bit more. Contrast this with 多 before a classifier after a round number.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我等了一个多小时。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ děng le yī gè duō xiǎoshí 。",
                "meaning": "I waited for a little over an hour.",
                "audio": "400a3309e3211a072eedad618d3a39c4ac2c927044c41396ce93d14ae479f670"
              },
              {
                "text": "这个一米多长。",
                "pinyin": "zhè gè yī mǐ duō cháng 。",
                "meaning": "This is a little over a meter long.",
                "audio": "d99aed5bbdeabb712f70a0e398705cec64d534fc0d620845c2611be408e036e4"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
